{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-vang-kp3l-eqvc-xvzn","published":"2026-11-11T15:55:45Z","modified":"2026-11-16T02:36:21.093931968Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-97206"],"summary":"NLnet Labs Unbound, 1.22.0 up to and including version 1.26.1, contains a DNS-over-QUIC (DoQ) lifetime bug reachable by…","details":"NLnet Labs Unbound, 1.22.0 up to and including version 1.26.1, contains a DNS-over-QUIC (DoQ) lifetime bug reachable by a remote DoQ client under multi-threaded operation. A client-triggered QUIC path migration can enter stream/connection cleanup while a mesh reply still retains a pointer to the DoQ stream. Cleanup frees the DoQ stream and when the pending mesh reply later completes it dereferences a stale pointer leading to a crash.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"unbound","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.24","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/unbound"},"versions":["1.25.1-r0","1.25.2-r0","1.25.2-r1","1.25.2-r2","1.25.2-r3"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-vang-kp3l-eqvc-xvzn.json"}},{"package":{"name":"unbound","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Debian:13","purl":"pkg:deb/dhi/unbound"},"versions":["1.22.0-2+deb13u3+dhi0","1.22.0-2+deb13u3+dhi1","1.26.1-0+deb13u1+dhi0","1.26.2-0+deb13u1+dhi0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-vang-kp3l-eqvc-xvzn.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://scout.docker.com/v/DHI-vang-kp3l-eqvc-xvzn"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-97206"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://security.alpinelinux.org/vuln/CVE-2026-97206"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-97206"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-97206"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://people.ubuntu.com/~ubuntu-security/cve/CVE-2026-97206"}],"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V3